      <p>In the Treasure Valley, spring and fall cleanups serve distinctly different purposes, and both play critical roles in maintaining healthy, attractive landscapes. These aren't interchangeable tasks - each targets specific seasonal challenges that Idaho properties face. Understanding the unique purpose of each cleanup helps you prioritize your lawn care budget and ensures your property receives the right care at the right time.</p>

